{"metadata":{"transaction_key":"deprecated","request_id":"019eaf12-2220-7160-ae13-1c9eee7ca07d","sha256":"d03ed61ae11743c70cdbdc7fc1c6f70ffedef598d02179e91e9078f44e59ace3","created":"2026-06-10T01:07:46.903Z","duration":164.6493,"channels":1,"models":["1abfe86b-e047-4eed-858a-35e5625b41ee"],"model_info":{"1abfe86b-e047-4eed-858a-35e5625b41ee":{"name":"2-general-nova","version":"2024-01-06.5664","arch":"nova-2"}}},"results":{"channels":[{"alternatives":[{"transcript":"Often, providers refuse to treat injured workers because it is difficult to receive payment for the treatment. Daisybill is end to end workers' comp revenue cycle management management software that gets workers' comp bills paid in fewer than nine days on average. For providers using Daisy Bill, sending a workers' comp bill requires only two simple steps. Step one, import or enter your workers' comp bill data into Daisy Bill. Step two, upload PDFs of the medical documents you need to send with the bill. In just two simple steps, your work is done, and Daisy bill does the rest. Daisy bill converts your bill data into a compliant state or federal workers' comp bill, attaches the medical documents to the bill, and delivers your bill and medical documents to the designated claims administrator. In workers' comp, a claims administrator, also called a payer or carrier, is responsible for paying workers' comp bills. Daisy Bill sends more than 92% of providers' bills to claims administrators electronically as eBills. Daisy Bill's proprietary eBilling technology sends each eBill with the correct payer ID, so you don't need to track these e billing details. For claims administrators that use a clearinghouse vendor, Daisybill sends e bills directly to each claims administrator's designated clearinghouse with the correct payer ID. CorVel and the Department of Labor do not use a clearinghouse vendor, so Daisybill sends providers' e bills directly to these two claims administrators. For 7% of providers' bills belonging to claims administrators that do not accept e bills, Daisybill knows the emails or fax numbers for these claims administrators. All of this billing technology means Daisybill mails less than half a percent of providers bills to claims administrators. No matter the bill delivery method, Daisy Bill technology gets workers' comp bills paid quickly. With Daisy Bill, it is easy to secure payment for treating injured workers because Daisy Bill's technology does all the hard work. Throughout The United States, thousands of providers use Daisy Bill to send millions of workers' comp bills to hundreds of claims administrators. With Daisy Bill, providers can confidently treat injured workers, help them return to work, and reclaim their lives. If you have questions, click the pink circle to chat with us free of charge. We want to help you.","confidence":0.99902344,"words":[{"word":"often","start":4.16,"end":4.66,"confidence":0.9399414,"punctuated_word":"Often,"},{"word":"providers","start":4.7999997,"end":5.2999997,"confidence":0.9951172,"punctuated_word":"providers"},{"word":"refuse","start":5.3599997,"end":5.8399997,"confidence":0.84765625,"punctuated_word":"refuse"},{"word":"to","start":5.8399997,"end":6.08,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"to"},{"word":"treat","start":6.08,"end":6.3999996,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"treat"},{"word":"injured","start":6.3999996,"end":6.7999997,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"injured"},{"word":"workers","start":6.7999997,"end":7.2799997,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"workers"},{"word":"because","start":7.2799997,"end":7.6,"confidence":0.97998047,"punctuated_word":"because"},{"word":"it","start":7.6,"end":7.7599998,"confidence":0.99902344,"punctuated_word":"it"},{"word":"is","start":7.7599998,"end":8.08,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"is"},{"word":"difficult","start":8.08,"end":8.559999,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"difficult"},{"word":"to","start":8.559999,"end":8.72,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"to"},{"wo